{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"stronglyConnectedComponents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Components","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/Components","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity10ComponentsV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Components are in the order Tarjan’s algorithm completes them, on a depth-first search"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with roots in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order and successors in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"successors(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":" order. That is a reverse"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"topological order of the condensation: every edge between components goes from a later"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"component to an earlier one, so "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reversed()"},{"type":"text","text":" lists the components with every edge going"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"forward. Each component lists its vertices in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each component’s first vertex is its earliest in ","type":"text"},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so on a graph whose vertex","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"positions are insertion order (","type":"text"},{"code":"StableDirectedGraph","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), one sort by that vertex’s position","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"puts the components in insertion order, O(C log C) for C components:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let inInsertionOrder = graph.stronglyConnectedComponents()","    .sorted { graph.vertexPosition(of: $0.first!) < graph.vertexPosition(of: $1.first!) }"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On any graph, one pass over "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" lists them in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order, O(V):"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let components = graph.stronglyConnectedComponents()","let inVertexOrder = graph.vertices.compactMap { vertex in","    let component = components[components.component(of: vertex)]","    return component.first == vertex ? component : nil","}"]},{"type":"aside","name":"Complexity","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(V + E)."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph"]]},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/stronglyConnectedComponents()"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"Connectivity"}],"extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","title":"stronglyConnectedComponents()","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"stronglyConnectedComponents"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity10ComponentsV","text":"Components"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols08Directe